          {
            "source_link": "https://x.com/bridgebench/status/2090388152011706531?s=46",
            "suggestion": "Tibo is lying. Users of ChatGPT have complained bitterly of the nerfed usage limits. ",
            "suggestion_id": "2090692100115341727"
          },
          {
            "source_link": "https://x.com/alexgetmancom/status/2090432031578571137?s=46&t=0YL_hSh5_EezsNfVm6dFyw",
            "suggestion": "In response to thousands of users reporting greatly reduced Codex limits, this OpenAI employee accused their users of fraud. There is zero evidence that the thousands of users complaining about usage limit reductions engaged in fraudulent activity.  ",
