            "suggestion": "I had the issue, and I am using the Office app, so his claim is wrong. ",
            "suggestion_id": "2090698479232319624"
          },
          {
            "source_link": "https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2090675027670978569?s=46",
            "suggestion": "Many users claiming not even heard of sub2api are also experiencing usage drop. ",
